<view class="page">

  <view class="tabs">
    <view class="tab {{tab === 'list' ? 'on' : ''}}" data-tab="list" bindtap="onTabChange">名册（{{list.length}}）</view>
    <view class="tab {{tab === 'import' ? 'on' : ''}}" data-tab="import" bindtap="onTabChange">批量导入</view>
  </view>

  <block wx:if="{{tab === 'list'}}">

    <view class="card">
      <view class="sec-title">添加人员</view>
      <view class="add-row">
        <input class="add-input" placeholder="姓名" value="{{newName}}" bindinput="onNewName" maxlength="20" />
        <input class="add-input" placeholder="工号" value="{{newJobNo}}" bindinput="onNewJobNo" maxlength="20" />
      </view>
      <view class="add-row">
        <picker class="add-picker" mode="selector" range="{{deptOptions}}" value="{{newDeptIndex}}" bindchange="onNewDept">
          <view class="add-pick">{{newDeptText}}</view>
        </picker>
        <view class="add-btn" bindtap="addOne">添加</view>
      </view>
      <view class="hint-text">工号必填——本人认领身份时要填工号核对，名册里没有工号的人认领不了。电话由各人认领时自己填。</view>
    </view>

    <view class="card">
      <input class="search-input" placeholder="搜索姓名 / 工号" value="{{keyword}}" bindinput="onKeyword" />

      <scroll-view class="dept-bar" scroll-x enable-flex show-scrollbar="{{false}}">
        <view
          class="dept-chip {{item.value === deptFilter ? 'on' : ''}}"
          wx:for="{{deptTabs}}"
          wx:key="value"
          data-dept="{{item.value}}"
          bindtap="onDeptFilter"
        >{{item.label}}</view>
      </scroll-view>

      <view class="p-item" wx:for="{{filtered}}" wx:key="_id">
        <view class="pi-main">
          <text class="pi-name">{{item.name}}</text>
          <text class="pi-dept">{{item.dept}}</text>
          <text class="pi-jobno" wx:if="{{!item.needJobNo}}">工号 {{item.jobNo}}</text>
          <!-- 没工号的显式标出来：他本人认领时会被卡住，管理员得先补 -->
          <text class="pi-nojobno" wx:else>{{item.jobNoText}}</text>
          <text class="pi-phone" wx:if="{{item.phone}}">{{item.phone}}</text>
          <text class="pi-state {{item.stateClass}}">{{item.stateText}}</text>
          <text class="pi-admin" wx:if="{{item.isAdmin}}">管理员</text>
        </view>
        <view class="pi-actions">
          <text
            class="pi-act"
            data-id="{{item._id}}"
            data-name="{{item.name}}"
            data-jobno="{{item.jobNo}}"
            bindtap="editJobNo"
          >{{item.jobNoActionText}}</text>
          <text
            class="pi-act"
            wx:if="{{item.claimed}}"
            data-id="{{item._id}}"
            data-name="{{item.name}}"
            data-admin="{{item.isAdmin}}"
            bindtap="toggleAdmin"
          >{{item.adminActionText}}</text>
          <text class="pi-del" data-id="{{item._id}}" data-name="{{item.name}}" bindtap="removeOne">移除</text>
        </view>
      </view>

      <view class="empty" wx:if="{{filtered.length === 0}}">没有匹配的人员</view>
    </view>

    <view class="card">
      <view class="sec-title">修正管理员标记</view>
      <view class="hint-text">早期版本判断「第一个认领者」的逻辑有误，曾导致每个新认领的人都带上管理员标记。</view>
      <view class="hint-text">点下面的按钮可一次性清理：只保留你自己，其余全部取消管理员。</view>
      <view class="danger-btn" bindtap="fixAdmins">只保留我为管理员</view>
    </view>

  </block>

  <block wx:else>

    <view class="card">
      <view class="sec-title">粘贴部门名册</view>
      <view class="hint-text">每行一个人，需要「姓名 + 工号 + 科室」三列，可以直接从 Excel 复制粘贴进来。</view>
      <view class="hint-text">三列的顺序随意，程序自己认：张三,10086,1室 和 10086,张三,1室 都能识别。</view>
      <view class="hint-text">工号必填——本人认领身份时要填工号核对，缺工号的行不会导入。电话由各人认领后自己填，这里不用写。</view>
      <textarea
        class="roster-input"
        placeholder="张三,10086,1室"
        value="{{rosterText}}"
        maxlength="-1"
        bindinput="onRosterInput"
      />
      <view class="preview" wx:if="{{previewText}}">{{previewText}}</view>
      <view class="btn-primary import-btn" bindtap="doImport">导入</view>
    </view>

    <view class="card">
      <view class="sec-title">清空重来</view>
      <view class="hint-text">导入出错时可以清空重来，只会删掉还没人认领的记录，已认领的人不受影响。</view>
      <view class="danger-btn" bindtap="clearUnclaimed">清空未认领名册</view>
    </view>

  </block>

</view>
